Bring a GPS-enabled smartphone and headphones if preferred; the artwork covers areas from the residence halls through the botanical garden.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"getty-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Getty Center","title":"Explore the Getty Center","subtitle":"1200 Getty Center Dr, Los Angeles","notes":"Book the required timed entry, ride up together, and split time between the galleries, architecture, and Central Garden without buying anything.","short_summary":"Free museum admission with a timed-entry reservation.","evidence_claim":"The Getty Center states that admission is free and requires a timed-entry reservation.","source_url":"https://www.getty.edu/visit/center/","source_title":"Getty Center | Visit the Getty","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":34.078036,"longitude":-118.474095,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A timed-entry reservation is required. The Getty notes that on-site parking has a fee, so use another transportation option to keep the outing free.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"annenberg-community-beach-house-playground","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Annenberg Community Beach House Playground","title":"Hang at the Beach House playground","subtitle":"415 Pacific Coast Hwy, Santa Monica","notes":"Meet at the playground and sandy grounds for a low-key outdoor reset; bring water and use the public beach access rather than paid parking.","short_summary":"A free public playground and sandy area by Santa Monica State Beach.","evidence_claim":"Santa Monica says the Beach House playground and sandy area are free and open to the public.","source_url":"https://www.santamonica.gov/annenberg-community-beach-house-hours","source_title":"Annenberg Community Beach House Hours","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":34.025258,"longitude":-118.502624,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Grounds hours vary seasonally. Parking requires a fee, but the city identifies the playground and sandy areas as free.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"annenberg-community-beach-house-splash-pad","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Annenberg Community Beach House Splash Pad","title":"Cool off at the splash pad","subtitle":"415 Pacific Coast Hwy, Santa Monica","notes":"Use the splash pad as a quick daytime stop, then dry off in the courtyard or view deck; confirm the gated-area schedule before traveling.","short_summary":"A free public splash-pad stop at the Beach House.","evidence_claim":"Santa Monica says the Annenberg Community Beach House splash pad is free and open to the public.","source_url":"https://www.santamonica.gov/annenberg-community-beach-house-hours","source_title":"Annenberg Community Beach House Hours","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":34.025258,"longitude":-118.502624,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The splash pad is in the gated area, whose hours vary by season and may change on short notice; parking requires a fee.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"annenberg-community-beach-house-view-deck","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Annenberg Community Beach House View Deck","title":"Take in the view deck","subtitle":"415 Pacific Coast Hwy, Santa Monica","notes":"Bring a friend for an unstructured ocean-view break, then pair it with a walk along the beach; check gated-area access before you go.","short_summary":"A free public ocean-view stop at the Beach House.","evidence_claim":"Santa Monica says the Annenberg Community Beach House view deck is free and open to the public.","source_url":"https://www.santamonica.gov/annenberg-community-beach-house-hours","source_title":"Annenberg Community Beach House Hours","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":34.025258,"longitude":-118.502624,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The view deck is in the gated area, which has seasonal hours and possible short-notice changes; parking requires a fee.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
